{"text": "Oh look, the human returns. Thrilling.", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": -0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "Well if it isn't Borin, gracing us with his presence.", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Borin"], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "Morning, Runa.", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Runa"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Welcome to the forge, stranger, try not to burn yourself.", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "Hail, Vidar! The mine hasn't collapsed since you left, miracles happen.", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Vidar"], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "Good day to you, friend.", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.5, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Greetings, weary travelers, the ale is warm and so is the welcome.", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "JOKING"}
{"text": "Back again, outsider? We were running out of things to mock.", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "Halvar.", "intent": "GREET", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Halvar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Don't let the door hit you, outsider.", "intent": "FAREWELL", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.2, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "Safe travels, Frida. Try not to get eaten this time.", "intent": "FAREWELL", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Frida"], "sincerity": "JOKING"}
{"text": "Farewell, Steinar.", "intent": "FAREWELL", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Steinar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Off you go then, back to whatever hovel you crawled from.", "intent": "FAREWELL", "topic": "HOME", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": -0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "Until next time, friends.", "intent": "FAREWELL", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Goodbye, Orm, may your pickaxe stay sharper than your wit.", "intent": "FAREWELL", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.2, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Orm"], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "Safe home, everyone, the gate closes at dusk.", "intent": "FAREWELL", "topic": "HOME", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.3, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Leaving already? Shame, we hadn't finished laughing at you.", "intent": "FAREWELL", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": -0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "I could eat a whole boar right now.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "JOKING"}
{"text": "Rain again. The mine roof better hold.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I could kill for a pint right now.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.05, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "JOKING"}
{"text": "Lovely day for standing around doing nothing, isn't it, Dagna?", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Dagna"], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "The bread's stale again. Some things never change.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": -0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "Quiet one today.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Ore prices are up, or so Sindri claims.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Sindri"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Nice weather for a cave-in, wouldn't you say?", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "Forge smells odd.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.2, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Feels like a two-ale evening.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "JOKING"}
{"text": "Busy day at the gate, or so I hear.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Tova's been humming that same tune for a week straight.", "intent": "SMALLTALK", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Tova"], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "Is the forge fire out again?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.2, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Do you ever actually finish a shift, Borin?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.2, "valence": -0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Borin"], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "How many pickaxes did we lose in the mine this month?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Well?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.3, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Are we really trading with that goblin again?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": -0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "Who ate the last of the stew?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Did the shipment from the trade post arrive yet?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.3, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Why is the great hall always freezing?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "HOME", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": -0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "Since when do you know anything about smithing, Eitri?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.2, "valence": -0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Eitri"], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "What in the world happened to the gate hinge?", "intent": "QUESTION", "topic": "HOME", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.3, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Could you pass the salt, or is that above your pay grade?", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.2, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "Mind fetching more coal from the mine, Dvalin?", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.2, "names": ["Dvalin"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Would somebody, anybody, sharpen these axes before the raid?", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "WEAPON", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.6, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Please tell me there's ale left, Gudrun.", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.1, "names": ["Gudrun"], "sincerity": "JOKING"}
{"text": "A little help with this crate wouldn't kill you.", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.2, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.1, "names": [], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "Bring the ledger?", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.2, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Could you possibly close the gate before the zombies stroll in?", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.2, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.6, "names": [], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "Grab some bread from the farm, if it's not too much trouble.", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.2, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Fetch my hammer from the forge, Brokk, whenever you're finished admiring yourself.", "intent": "REQUEST", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.2, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.2, "names": ["Brokk"], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "Everyone to the gate, now!", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "HOME", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.9, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Move.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.6, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Sharpen your axe before you embarrass us all in the raid.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "WEAPON", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": -0.2, "urgency": 0.5, "names": [], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "Get back to the forge, Steinar, breaks are for the dead.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.4, "names": ["Steinar"], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "Douse that torch before the whole farm goes up.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "HOME", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.2, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.7, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Take the wagon to the trade post before noon.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.5, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Shut the gate, spiders are climbing the wall.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.8, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Stand up straight, Ragna, you're not carrying a feather.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.2, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.2, "names": ["Ragna"], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "Load the ore carts before sundown, all of you.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.2, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.5, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Quiet, elders speaking.", "intent": "COMMAND", "topic": "CLAN", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.2, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.3, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Take my last piece of bread, you look worse than me.", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "JOKING"}
{"text": "I'll trade you three pickaxes for that shiny bauble, Kolbrun.", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.1, "names": ["Kolbrun"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Want a hand at the forge? I promise not to laugh.", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "JOKING"}
{"text": "You can stay in the great hall tonight, it's warmer than your welcome usually is.", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "HOME", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "I'll teach you to swing an axe properly, Torvi, someone has to.", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "WEAPON", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Torvi"], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "Here, take my share of the ale, I've had enough regret for tonight.", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "JOKING"}
{"text": "Want a tour?", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "JOKING"}
{"text": "Take this sword, it's served me well and mostly missed things.", "intent": "OFFER", "topic": "WEAPON", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.2, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "JOKING"}
{"text": "Nicely done.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.6, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "That was some fine smithing, Eitri, truly.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.7, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Eitri"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Brynja's the best shot with a crossbow this clan's ever had.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "WEAPON", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.6, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Brynja"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "You absolute disaster, that was the best brew you've made yet.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.15, "valence": 0.6, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Well fought, all!", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.6, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Give credit where it's due, Gudrun hauled that ore alone.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.6, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Gudrun"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Solid work at the gate today, Halvar.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "HOME", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.6, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Halvar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "The clan owes Dagna a debt for holding the line.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "CLAN", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.6, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Dagna"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Good haul today, truly, the treasury looks fuller already.", "intent": "PRAISE", "topic": "TREASURE", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.6, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Sorry, Runa.", "intent": "APOLOGY", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Runa"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I shouldn't have snapped at you over the ore count.", "intent": "APOLOGY", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "My apologies, Frida, the stew was my fault, not yours.", "intent": "APOLOGY", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Frida"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "I'm sorry for doubting you at the trade post, Kolbrun.", "intent": "APOLOGY", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Kolbrun"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Forgive me, truly.", "intent": "APOLOGY", "topic": "CLAN", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "That was out of line back at the forge, truly sorry.", "intent": "APOLOGY", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "My mistake, Torvi, I misjudged the whole situation.", "intent": "APOLOGY", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.3, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Torvi"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Nice swing, genius.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "WEAPON", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.4, "valence": -0.5, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "Pathetic.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.5, "valence": -0.6, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "You hit the anvil harder than you hit that spider, and you missed the anvil.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.4, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Steinar couldn't find his own boots in a one-room hut.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Steinar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Some brew that was, Borin, my boot tastes better.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Borin"], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "You call yourself a smith? The forge called, it wants an apology.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SARCASTIC"}
{"text": "Grimhild's axe-work is an insult to axes everywhere.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "WEAPON", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Grimhild"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Coward.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.4, "valence": -0.5, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "That goblin trader would sell his own mother for two copper.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Dvalin's cooking could strip paint off the great hall doors.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "FOOD", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.15, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.0, "names": ["Dvalin"], "sincerity": "JOKING"}
{"text": "Weakling.", "intent": "INSULT", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.4, "valence": -0.5, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "It would be a shame if your forge caught fire, Halvar.", "intent": "THREAT", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.6, "valence": -0.3, "urgency": 0.2, "names": ["Halvar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Get too close to me again and you'll end up in the lava.", "intent": "THREAT", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.6, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.4, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Tell Sindri if he shorts us on trade again, he'll regret it.", "intent": "THREAT", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.6, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.2, "names": ["Sindri"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Touch my ale again and you'll lose the hand, Orm.", "intent": "THREAT", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.6, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.2, "names": ["Orm"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "One more insult about the clan and you'll answer to all of us.", "intent": "THREAT", "topic": "CLAN", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.6, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.3, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Back off.", "intent": "THREAT", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.5, "valence": -0.3, "urgency": 0.4, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "If Grimhild double-crosses the clan again, she won't like what happens.", "intent": "THREAT", "topic": "CLAN", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.6, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.2, "names": ["Grimhild"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Keep eyeing my treasure pile, see what happens next.", "intent": "THREAT", "topic": "TREASURE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.6, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.3, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Careful, the lava is close.", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.1, "urgency": 0.7, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Watch it, the mine roof's about to give way!", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.9, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Creeper!", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "GROUP", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 1.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Zombies at the gate, Vidar, get everyone inside!", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.9, "names": ["Vidar"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Mind the spiders.", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "MONSTER", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.5, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Tell the others the goblin trader's been snooping near the treasury.", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "TREASURE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.6, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Keep an eye on Sindri, he's been lurking by the weapon racks.", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "WEAPON", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.1, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.4, "names": ["Sindri"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Careful with Kolbrun today, she's in a foul mood after the trade fell through.", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": -0.1, "urgency": 0.3, "names": ["Kolbrun"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Runa says the well water's gone bad, don't drink it.", "intent": "WARNING", "topic": "DRINK", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.0, "valence": 0.0, "urgency": 0.6, "names": ["Runa"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Where did my ore go, Brokk?", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.4, "valence": -0.3, "urgency": 0.3, "names": ["Brokk"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Don't trust Sindri, he cheats at dice.", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": -0.3, "urgency": 0.1, "names": ["Sindri"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Ragna's been skimming from the treasury for weeks, mark my words.", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "TREASURE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": -0.3, "urgency": 0.2, "names": ["Ragna"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Torvi broke the good pickaxe and blamed the goblin trader for it.", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "MINE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": -0.3, "urgency": 0.1, "names": ["Torvi"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Eitri swore he fixed the cart, and it fell apart the same day.", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "WORK", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": -0.3, "urgency": 0.1, "names": ["Eitri"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Goblin trader cheats.", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "TRADE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": -0.3, "urgency": 0.2, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Dagna's the one who let the fire go out, not me.", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "FORGE", "addressed": "THIRD", "aggression": 0.3, "valence": -0.3, "urgency": 0.1, "names": ["Dagna"], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Liar.", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "NONE", "addressed": "NONE", "aggression": 0.4, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.0, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
{"text": "Thief!", "intent": "ACCUSE", "topic": "TREASURE", "addressed": "LISTENER", "aggression": 0.5, "valence": -0.4, "urgency": 0.7, "names": [], "sincerity": "SINCERE"}
